      "title_zh": "学开车",
      "title_en": "Learning to drive",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "正在", "学", "开", "朋友", "的", "车", "。", "这", "真", "难", "！"],
        ["前", "两", "次", "，", "我", "错", "了", "很", "多", "。", "那", "两", "次", "我", "都", "没", "开", "好", "。"],
        ["朋友", "坐", "在", "车", "里", "帮", "我", "。", "他", "说", "：", "“", "别", "太", "快", "！", "”"],
        ["今天", "，", "我", "一", "次", "也", "没有", "错", "！", "朋友", "笑", "了", "，", "说", "：", "“", "你", "真", "行", "！", "”", "我", "也", "笑", "了", "。"],
        ["我", "想", "明天", "再", "开", "一", "次", "。", "多", "开", "几", "次", "，", "就", "不", "难", "了", "！"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I'm learning to drive my friend's car. It's really hard!",
        "The first two times, I made lots of mistakes. Both times I didn’t drive well.",
        "My friend sits in the car and helps me. He says: “Don’t go too fast!”",
        "Today I didn’t make a single mistake! My friend laughed and said: “You’re really good!” I laughed too.",
        "I want to drive again tomorrow. Drive a few more times and it won’t be hard any more!"
      ],
      "names": [],
