        ["回", "家", "后", "，", "我", "想", "：", "“", "不", "对", "！", "他", "少", "给", "了", "我", "两", "块", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "再", "去", "找", "他", "。", "他", "笑", "了", "，", "拿", "钱", "给", "我", "。"],
        ["买", "东西", "的", "时候", "，", "我们", "都", "要", "看", "一", "看", "手", "里", "的", "钱", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Today I wanted a drink of water, so I went to buy some. I asked: “How much?” He said: “Three kuai.”",
        "I bought two and gave him ten kuai. He gave me two kuai back.",
        "When I got home I thought: “That’s not right! He gave me two kuai too little!”",
        "I went back to find him. He laughed and handed me the money.",
        "When we buy things, we should all check the money in our hands."
      ],
